<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, have you calmed down?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s breathing had calmed somewhat, but she still didn't look able to stand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"N-<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">, still sitting, gripped both my hands tightly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s hands were burning so that I couldn't tell if they were hot or cold, and damp with sweat.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I sat down too and brought my eyes level with </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's okay, I'm right here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Please...! Don't go to the police...! 
{PAUSE ""}
