Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> threw her arms around me, not caring who saw.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">... I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm not going anywhere, I wanted to say, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was at the police station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I couldn't just leave that alone either.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">At the police station, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Frightened when she heard the police mentioned, starting to make excuses to me, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And that dream.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I don't want to imagine it, but the victim this time really is...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">So, should I go to the police station, or take </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> and run?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
